              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Survey among inhabitants of Haarlem concerning several  aspects of the municipal policy. R.'s opinion about having office hours for vaccination  of travellers / live on r.'s income / City Bank of  Haarlem / living environment in the centre of the city  / opening of shops at sunday / quality improvement  of the district of Schalkwijk / possibility of buying  homes which were originally rented by inhabitants /  attractiveness of Haarlem / parking / public toilets  / parking facilities for bicycles / municipal service  / municipal archives / safety / used media for information  about Haarlem / role of district councils / recreational  issues / use of cultural facilities / environmental  issues / green space planning / maintenance of city  districts / Ecoteams. Background variables: basic characteristics/ residence/ household characteristics/ place of work/ occupation/employment/ income/capital assets/ education/ politics/ consumption of durables</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
